 "caption": "Xia et al. 2016 Sci. Rep. 6:35943, Fig. 3g (the outlet: leg 7's last post rows and the leads) at 1.798 \u00b5m/px (the rc6 scale 1.798 \u00b5m/px: the mean of the printed widths, the post columns' separations and the loop curvature (data/r6/rc6_values.json); rotation 0.20\u00b0) with the variant mask xia2016_rs7_depicted_fig3 (F 0.94072, D 6.5705 um, read off Figs. 3g and 3a).  Registration: scale from the printed widths, column separations and loop curvature, rotation measured on the image; translation fitted on features and, independently, by chamfer matching (they agree within 0.2 / 1.8 px along / across).  Nearest-outline offset: median 1.35 \u00b5m, 90th percentile 12.66 \u00b5m (n 4368); for comparison 10.83 \u00b5m with the mask shifted half a pitch along and 4.13 \u00b5m with it shifted 5 \u00b5m across.  On the image at this scale: centre 148.3 \u00b5m (printed 150), posts 73.2 / 71.7 (mask 70.9), post columns 220.8 apart (mask 220.9), pitch 51.73 (mask 51.80), left side channel 625 \u00b5m.",
